  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dshbase-catalog",
      "text": "Query the [dshbase](https://dshbase.com) plugin directory from inside DeepSeek Harness — search, list, and get install commands for 1,100+ community plugins without leaving your session."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin add dshbase-catalog\n```\n\nRequires DeepSeek Harness 0.2, including Desktop `0.2.0-rc.2`. Framework packages (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools`, `@deepseek-ai/cordis`) are `peerDependencies` resolved from the host install, and every tool `parameters` block is a JSON Schema object root."
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools",
      "text": "| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `search_dsh_plugins` | Full-text search across plugin name + description |\n| `get_dsh_plugin` | Look up one plugin: install command, verification status, stats |\n| `list_dsh_plugins` | List plugins by category |\n| `get_dsh_stats` | Catalog totals (plugins, npm vs git, verification) |\n| `get_dsh_categories` | All categories with counts |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Data",
      "text": "The catalog snapshot is regenerated daily from the live [dshbase](https://dshbase.com) directory (see `scripts/sync-catalog.py`), so the built-in index stays current."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
